direction: right
title: Non-Static Inner Class Memory Leak: Hidden Outer.this Reference

ThreadPool: Long-Lived ThreadPool Queue (GC Root) {
  style.fill: "#1C1917"
  style.stroke: "#EF4444"
  status: "Active GC Root (Never collected)"
  holds: "Queue retains submitted Runnable task references"
}

InnerTask: Anonymous Runnable Instance {
  style.fill: "#1E1B4B"
  style.stroke: "#8B5CF6"
  task: "executor.submit(new Runnable() { ... })"
  syntheticField: "final HeavyProcessingService this$0 (Compiler injected)"
}

HeavyService: HeavyProcessingService (100MB Retained) {
  style.fill: "#1C1917"
  style.stroke: "#EF4444"
  cache: "byte[] cache = 100MB"
  gc: "Uncollectible due to unbroken GC Root chain"
  error: "Triggers java.lang.OutOfMemoryError"
}

Solution: Architectural Fix {
  style.fill: "#06201B"
  style.stroke: "#10B981"
  fix1: "Use static nested class: static classes do NOT capture this$0"
  fix2: "Use standalone lambdas that capture only explicit parameters"
}

ThreadPool -> InnerTask: Holds task reference {
  style.stroke: "#EF4444"
}

InnerTask -> HeavyService: Implicit Outer.this pointer (this$0) {
  style.stroke: "#EF4444"
}
